// returned K off by 0.16 to 5.6 at Accuracy 0 with X exact to 1e-14: with
// a full-rank square B (no input reduction), and with a cross term S and
// rank-deficient B (m > n or duplicated inputs, solved in the reduced
// inputs). As the cost of K equals X there, no Newton step sees it. The
// oracle K moves 8e-9 to 3e-5 under eps perturbations of A, B, Q, R and
// S (5e-4 for the square B with S). COKNFU: draws 83, 288, 891, 1483, 528, 1088
